{"unit_id":"flytangyu__dsh-openai-image#card-zh","repo":"flytangyu/dsh-openai-image","commit":"e6df7447c98c6cccda895f28eb1612dbb2d82aab","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH OpenAI Image（DSH 插件，网页及可调用工具的客户端）：为 DSH 增加 OpenAI 图像生成与模型查询工具。它向 DSH 注册 generate_image 和 list_image_models，使用文字提示调用图像 API，并把生成结果保存到本机。主要功能包括实时查询可用绘图模型、单次选择模型、设置画幅与质量、生成透明背景图片以及一次生成多张图片。适合希望在 DSH 对话中制作插画、海报或图片素材的用户。使用前需要可调用图像模型的 OpenAI API Key；图片生成会请求 OpenAI 并使用其 API 额度。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:108","index.js:146","index.js:243","index.js:216"]}
{"unit_id":"flytangyu__dsh-openai-image#card-en","repo":"flytangyu/dsh-openai-image","commit":"e6df7447c98c6cccda895f28eb1612dbb2d82aab","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH OpenAI Image adds image tools to DSH. It sends prompts to OpenAI and saves images locally. Users can discover models, set size, quality and format, and generate transparent images or batches of four. It suits users making illustrations in DSH chats and requires an OpenAI image API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:108","index.js:146","index.js:243","index.js:216"]}
