{"unit_id":"flytangyu__dsh-openai-image#feature-1","repo":"flytangyu/dsh-openai-image","commit":"e6df7447c98c6cccda895f28eb1612dbb2d82aab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH OpenAI Image 的功能「实时查看绘图模型」：查询当前凭据可见的 OpenAI 绘图模型并返回默认模型。通过 list_image_models 工具触发，输出模型 ID 列表，不会生成图片。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:108","index.js:125"]}
{"unit_id":"flytangyu__dsh-openai-image#feature-2","repo":"flytangyu/dsh-openai-image","commit":"e6df7447c98c6cccda895f28eb1612dbb2d82aab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH OpenAI Image 的功能「文字生成图片」：按文字提示调用 OpenAI 图像模型。通过 generate_image 触发，输入提示词及可选参数，返回本机图片路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:146","index.js:159","index.js:216","index.js:238"]}
{"unit_id":"flytangyu__dsh-openai-image#feature-3","repo":"flytangyu/dsh-openai-image","commit":"e6df7447c98c6cccda895f28eb1612dbb2d82aab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH OpenAI Image 的功能「多张与多格式输出」：同一提示词可生成一至四张图，并选择 PNG、JPEG 或 WebP、尺寸、质量和背景。通过 generate_image 参数设置，返回每张图片各自的文件路径与格式信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:153","index.js:163","index.js:220"]}
{"unit_id":"flytangyu__dsh-openai-image#feature-4","repo":"flytangyu/dsh-openai-image","commit":"e6df7447c98c6cccda895f28eb1612dbb2d82aab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH OpenAI Image 的功能「本机图片保存」：将生成的图片写入配置的输出目录，默认使用 DSH 主目录下的 generated-images。工具返回绝对路径，供网页展示或其他 DSH 工具发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:40","index.js:212","index.js:225","index.js:231"]}
